      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ……\r\nあの娘の家は古い家系でね。",
        "official_en": "Aye... Our Mercedes hails from an old and illustrious family.",
        "real_en": "Yes... Her family has a long history."
      },
      "review": {
