    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_017:bbe2557f",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04",
        "key": "SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_017",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_017:bbe2557f",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_017:bbe2557f",
        "jp_sha256": "4d103abab7cc3bb4e3ddee7514f7f10d3bcf28b2219a025f14e67409e00d9380",
        "official_en_sha256": "9c4a169fc76d5b2745e1b61c7cf3ccf7f4935fa4d5d863b7d05a72e3affce425"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あの娘はよく、嫌なことがあったり\r\n考え事をするときは、滝の回廊にいったよ。\r\n水の音が落ち着くんだとさ。",
        "official_en": "She goes to Waterfall Way when she wants to get away from the world or reflect on something. The sound of the water helps calm her nerves, she says.",
        "real_en": "When something upset her or she had a lot on her mind, she'd often go to Waterfall Way. She said the sound of the water calmed her."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04",
