      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この街が海運で栄えていた頃、\r\n船乗りたちを取りまとめていたのが、\r\nあの娘の家だったのさ。",
        "official_en": "Back when this city was thriving on maritime trade, it was her family that employed the sailors.",
        "real_en": "Back when this city prospered through maritime trade, her family was responsible for organizing the sailors."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
