      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だけど、ちょうど先代の守り人さんの頃からかね。",
        "official_en": "However, around—when was it—ah, around the time of the previous generation of Wardens...",
        "real_en": "But I think it was around the time of the previous Warden..."
      },
      "review": {
