    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_014:6a7fdda5",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04",
        "key": "SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_014",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_014:6a7fdda5",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_014:6a7fdda5",
        "jp_sha256": "52325d5beedd4654ac5b6f700b354e5c04a83224f27990089ae35fe88e20e0a1",
        "official_en_sha256": "a1e1b504e00b55cc0c359f65351107493ed259c52761a771a9fee4177b77c53d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ですが、海賊行為が許されるわけではありません。\r\nもう一度止めに行かせてください。",
        "official_en": "However, that does not mean that they should be allowed to commit piracy with impunity. I will need to see them again and convince them to stop.",
        "real_en": "But that doesn't excuse piracy. Please let me go and stop them again."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
