        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_015:c3ba11da",
        "jp_sha256": "6b58f7a8ac43b4faaf47ea600d5586aca7599af66945d71c62704cbdaf93904b",
        "official_en_sha256": "57b95e3a0bc942be526642c2f3d5f8291c2b1f4a70d7493da5f9096074d61f0f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、逃げられちゃったし、\r\n今どこにいるんだろうな……。",
        "official_en": "They’ve sailed off, though. And I can’t think of any way we can track them.",
        "real_en": "But they got away. I wonder where they are now..."
