        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_011:9f7a96b0",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04:SubEv_C03_Mercedes_04_011:9f7a96b0",
        "jp_sha256": "bc689c0361ed74d544f29657c109d094983af5909fab4e79a9e1de86e6194581",
        "official_en_sha256": "dab11d767e404e9b718367aa97b018f2eaba844a4a6a2563b8189a3a7fe23f4f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "メルセデスちゃんは優しい娘だから、\r\n先代で職を失った船乗りたちまで\r\n面倒を見るつもりなんだろうね。",
        "official_en": "Being the sweet and caring girl that little Mercedes is, she probably took it upon herself to take care of all the sailors that lost their jobs.",
        "real_en": "Mercedes-chan is a kind girl. I imagine she even wants to look after the sailors who lost their jobs back in the previous Warden's time."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
