      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "大概のことは知っとるよ。\r\n生まれたばかりのメルセデスちゃんを\r\n取り上げたのは私だからねぇ。",
        "official_en": "Oh yes, just about all there is to know. In fact, I was the one who delivered little Mercedes when she was born.",
        "real_en": "I know just about everything there is to know. After all, I delivered Mercedes-chan when she was born."
