        "official_en_sha256": "ff321116614812edbbfa33f1502b2b87e185cc842071c00cf01e9c33723fc969"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "守り人さんには、普段世話になっているしな……。\r\n心当たりを教えてやろう。",
        "official_en": "The Wardens have always been good to me, so I trust that you will do right by her. I believe I know where little Mercedes might be.",
        "real_en": "You've always looked after me, Warden, so I'll tell you where she might be."
