      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "船が空を飛ぶようになって……\r\n海運の需要が一気に減っちゃってね。\r\n多くの船乗りが職を失った。",
        "official_en": "We started seeing those flying ships taking over more and more trade, and...well, you can probably guess what happened. Demand for the old ships dwindled and many sailors were put out of work.",
        "real_en": "When airships became common, demand for shipping by sea fell sharply. A lot of sailors lost their jobs."
